From 48879a851a3bf53d16bd0e16d0f78ed91870f5b2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: saytoonz <35128520+saytoonz@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 26 Jun 2026 12:42:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/8] bin(analyze_snapshot): cascade rerouting probe 2b
 (caller<-callerViaPatched)

Adds a probe that transplants the CALLER itself with a bytecode body calling the
patched code, then re-invokes caller(). Proves cascade-as-bytecode rerouting on
the no-JIT runtime (caller()=caller-> PATCH-CRASH-FIXED) with no trampoline/DD.
bin/ only -> no snapshot-version-hash bump. Sync to sankofa-dart-sdk fork.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
